        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis, Count of Armagnac; Albert II, Prince of Monaco; Umberto II of Italy; Diana Álvares Pereira de Melo\n- Roles: Prince of Monaco; King of Italy; Duchess of Cadaval\n- Places: Italy; Monaco\n\nFacts:\n- Louis, Count of Armagnac, was an ancestor of Albert II, Prince of Monaco, Umberto II of Italy, and Diana Álvares Pereira de Melo, 11th Duchess of Cadaval.\n- Umberto II of Italy was born on 15 September 1904 and died on 18 March 1983.\n- Umberto II of Italy, whose full Italian name was Umberto Nicola Tommaso Giovanni Maria di Savoia, was the last King of Italy.",
